Where we use Js ?

JS is just like a bridge for data abse and UI.

HTML,Java script were connected for browser .

HTML is created to connect Java script.

How to embed js code internally in HTML ?
we need to type <script>your code </script> inside .html file
ex: we have written a alert command below the meta in html form where we can use an popup coming everytime when user trys to interact with browser/website.

How to import JS file into html ?
type inside html <script src="js file name"></script>

Note: Its always good to call script as seperate compare to above one because it takes less time to load.


Now we can Call above script methods inside body and outside body as well inside html.
1) If we call inside body it will load content first and then script but it creates some disturbance.
2)If we load the data outside body then the script executes first then content will appear but if script is heavy user need to wait more time.

so the good option is use async word wwhen we call script before body this makes both body and script load at same time.
ex: <script src="js file path",async><script/>

But if we use async if we have more than one scripts but t some point of time script 3 should execute post script 2 but if we use async it loads all at parallel.

So, in this way we can use defer which is same as async but its gonna make one by one scripts and wait.

Note: So using defer inside script is the best solution.

**It is not recommended to create more JS files as it slows down the server and takes long time to respond sometimes even to connect also tkaes more time.


